{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_29", "source_id": "65296386000000001d01458a", "title": "素颜被夸嘭嘭白", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65296386000000001d01458a", "topic_family": "抗老与紧致", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1106, "evidence_unit_count": 25, "original_evidence_unit_count": 25, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["我一直追求素颜自由，在我看来素颜自由应该要皮肤细腻、光洁、亮白、紧致", "刚好前段时间雅顿升级了他家的粉胶, 我就入手了, 和银胶一起搭配使用, 发现效果更好耶，在白亮的同时皮肤也细腻紧致了不少", "又简单又有效，分享给你们❤ 希望每个宝宝的皮肤都是嘭嘭白的好状态❤️", "Elizabeth Arden NEWYORK", "啫喱质地非常好吸收 吸收完之后脸是哑光的状态 非常清爽不油腻", "最后分享一下我的用法：一次一颗很方便，我一般晚上洗完脸就直接爽肤水➕一颗，如果觉得干的话可以再加个面霜", "是我的真爱美白精华 但是入秋以后呢，只做美白就不够了，天一干燥就容易出现小细纹，所以秋冬真得“大补”才能实现弯道超车"], "retained_quotes": ["最后分享一下我的用法：一次一颗很方便，我一般晚上洗完脸就直接爽肤水➕一颗，如果觉得干的话可以再加个面霜", "是我的真爱美白精华 但是入秋以后呢，只做美白就不够了，天一干燥就容易出现小细纹，所以秋冬真得“大补”才能实现弯道超车"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65296386000000001d01458a/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65296386000000001d01458a/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65296386000000001d01458a/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65296386000000001d01458a/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "8253243f0807c27f62fd238af5ab42f37618d2f7285dd3873db9249479496c10", "card_hash": "fd7239237d62f50cc34cb3767bc8dbe750164b24a38ec04c93319e4cb52db5d3", "callab